## 🛠️ Technical Details

### New Data Models
- **Supplier:** Track name, unique code, and contact information.
- **PurchaseOrder:** Tracks order status (Draft, Ordered, Received) and total valuation.
- **Batch:** The core of the FEFO system. Tracks quantity remaining per expiry date.

### API Logic Implementation
```typescript
// Auto-Batch Generation on PO Receipt
if (status === 'RECEIVED') {
  for (const item of receivedItems) {
    await Batch.create({
      product: item.product,
      batchNumber: `BN-${po.poNumber}-${sku}`,
      expiryDate: item.expiryDate,
      initialQuantity: item.quantity,
      currentQuantity: item.quantity
    });
  }
}
```

